# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages — all routes serve index.html.
# A handful of exact paths (/admin, /admin/orders, /admin/books, /books,
# /order) are pre-empted by stale edge-cached HTML from the project's
# original Next.js deployment, and /admin is additionally redirected by the
# pages.dev platform once Functions are used. Explicit 301 redirects are
# served from the rules layer and bypass that stale cache, so each affected
# path is redirected to its trailing-slash variant.
/admin /admin/ 301
/admin/orders /admin/orders/ 301
/admin/books /admin/books/ 301
/books /books/ 301
/order /order/ 301
/admin/ /index.html 200
/admin/* /index.html 200
/* /index.html 200
